00:11:15,859 --> 00:11:19,193
Oo, masakit talaga.

251
00:11:19,216 --> 00:11:23,056
Kaya naman, magpahinga ka na lang nang mabuti.

252
00:11:23,079 --> 00:11:25,246
Naiintindihan ko po.

253
00:11:25,269 --> 00:11:27,602
Tatawagan ko ang opisina.

254
00:11:27,625 --> 00:11:31,658
Pwede ka nang pumasok sa makalawa.

255
00:11:31,681 --> 00:11:33,495
Mabuti naman.

256
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:36,895
Pero huwag kang magpupumilit, ha?

257
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:40,174
Oo, mag-iingat ako.

258
00:11:40,198 --> 00:11:43,198
May iba ka pa bang tanong?

259
00:11:43,221 --> 00:11:47,864
Kailangan ba inumin ang gamot gamit ang tubig?

260
00:11:47,887 --> 00:11:53,170
Oo, inumin mo sa tubig o mainit na tubig.

261
00:11:53,193 --> 00:11:56,427
Bawal ba sa tsaa?

262
00:11:56,450 --> 00:11:59,783
Hindi masyadong maganda ang tsaa.

263
00:11:59,806 --> 00:12:02,173
Paano naman ang juice?

264
00:12:02,196 --> 00:12:05,162
Huwag din sa juice.

265
00:12:05,185 --> 00:12:06,785
Naiintindihan ko po.

266
00:12:06,808 --> 00:12:09,085
Inumin ko na lang sa tubig.

267
00:12:09,109 --> 00:12:11,525
Okay ka na ba sa iba?

268
00:12:11,548 --> 00:12:14,317
Isa pa lang, pwede ba?

269
00:12:14,341 --> 00:12:17,007
Oo, ano po iyon?

270
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:20,248
Kailan ako dapat bumalik?

271
00:12:20,272 --> 00:12:23,677
Bumalik ka kapag naubos na ang gamot.

272
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:26,467
Ilang araw ang ibibigay?

273
00:12:26,490 --> 00:12:29,373
Tatlong araw ang ibibigay ko.

274
00:12:29,396 --> 00:12:31,330
Naiintindihan ko po.

275
00:12:31,353 --> 00:12:35,119
Kung nawala na ang sakit, hindi ka na kailangang bumalik.

276
00:12:35,142 --> 00:12:36,952
Naiintindihan ko po.

277
00:12:36,976 --> 00:12:39,109
Salamat po.

278
00:12:39,132 --> 00:12:40,632
Tagpo 9: Pagsusuri at Bayaran

279
00:12:40,632 --> 00:12:43,199
Salamat sa pagod mo.

280
00:12:43,222 --> 00:12:45,289
Salamat po.

281
00:12:45,312 --> 00:12:48,192
Sige, bayaran na natin.

282
00:12:48,215 --> 00:12:51,149
Oo, magkano po?

283
00:12:51,172 --> 00:12:55,505
Ang bayad sa pagsusuri ngayon ay 1500 yen.

284
00:12:55,528 --> 00:12:58,936
Pwede bang gumamit ng credit card?

285
00:12:58,959 --> 00:13:01,526
Oo, pwede naman.

286
00:13:01,549 --> 00:13:04,959
Sige, card na lang po.

287
00:13:04,983 --> 00:13:06,716
Salamat po.

288
00:13:06,739 --> 00:13:10,586
Saan ko kukunin ang gamot?

289
00:13:10,609 --> 00:13:14,676
May botika sa labas ng ospital.

290
00:13:14,699 --> 00:13:16,504
Nasaan po iyon?

291
00:13:16,527 --> 00:13:20,494
Lumabas ka ng ospital, tapos kumaliwa ka.

292
00:13:20,517 --> 00:13:22,317
Kaliwa po, 'di ba?

293
00:13:22,341 --> 00:13:26,559
Oo, may malaking botika doon.

294
00:13:26,582 --> 00:13:28,516
Naiintindihan ko po.

295
00:13:28,539 --> 00:13:31,205
Ito ang reseta mo.

296
00:13:31,228 --> 00:13:33,295
Ireseta ito.

297
00:13:33,318 --> 00:13:37,173
Oo, ipasa mo ito sa parmasya.

298
00:13:37,197 --> 00:13:39,175
Naiintindihan ko po.

299
00:13:39,198 --> 00:13:42,210
Ibabalik ko na ang iyong reseta card.

300
00:13:42,234 --> 00:13:43,967
Salamat po.

301
00:13:43,990 --> 00:13:47,285
Paano ang susunod na appointment?

302
00:13:47,309 --> 00:13:52,042
Sabi ng doktor, kapag naubos na ang gamot.

303
00:13:52,065 --> 00:13:55,102
Kung gayon, sa makalawa na.

304
00:13:55,126 --> 00:13:57,759
Sa Biyernes po sana.

305
00:13:57,782 --> 00:14:00,865
Anong oras sa Biyernes ang gusto mo?

306
00:14:00,889 --> 00:14:03,889
Paano ang ika-3 ng hapon?

307
00:14:03,912 --> 00:14:06,770
Oo, ika-3 ng hapon.

308
00:14:06,794 --> 00:14:08,727
Sige, ayos lang.

309
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:10,204
Salamat po.

310
00:14:10,228 --> 00:14:12,318
Ingatan mo ang iyong kalusugan.

311
00:14:12,341 --> 00:14:14,474
Salamat po.

312
00:14:14,497 --> 00:14:15,997
Tagpo 10: Paano Kunin ang Iyong Reseta na Gamot

313
00:14:15,997 --> 00:14:17,865
Kumusta po.

314
00:14:17,889 --> 00:14:21,022
Pakiabot ang reseta ko.

315
00:14:21,045 --> 00:14:22,900
Kumusta po.

316
00:14:22,924 --> 00:14:25,124
Ito po.

317
00:14:25,147 --> 00:14:28,481
Sige, kumpirmahin ko.

318
00:14:28,504 --> 00:14:31,337
Gaano po katagal ang paghihintay?

319
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:33,973
Agad-agad po itong magagawa.

320
00:14:33,997 --> 00:14:36,133
Mga limang minuto lang.

321
00:14:36,156 --> 00:14:37,967
Naiintindihan ko.

322
00:14:37,991 --> 00:14:40,324
Pasensya na sa paghihintay.

323
00:14:40,347 --> 00:14:42,217
Oo.

324
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:44,927
May dalawang uri ng gamot.

325
00:14:44,951 --> 00:14:47,352
Dalawang uri pala.

326
00:14:47,376 --> 00:14:52,343
Ito ay gamot para sa sakit ng tiyan.

327
00:14:52,366 --> 00:14:54,603
Kailan ko ito iinumin?

328
00:14:54,626 --> 00:14:58,793
Uminom ng tatlong beses sa isang araw.

329
00:14:58,816 --> 00:15:00,706
Bago kumain?

330
00:15:00,729 --> 00:15:02,600
Pagkatapos kumain?

331
00:15:02,624 --> 00:15:05,424
Uminom pagkatapos kumain.

332
00:15:05,447 --> 00:15:07,464
Naiintindihan ko po.

333
00:15:07,487 --> 00:15:10,854
Sa umaga, tanghali, at gabi.

334
00:15:10,877 --> 00:15:12,210
Oo.

335
00:15:12,233 --> 00:15:15,872
Sa umaga, tanghali, at gabi pala.

336
00:15:15,896 --> 00:15:19,565
At ito naman ay gamot para sa sikmura.

337
00:15:19,588 --> 00:15:22,921
Tatlong beses din ba sa isang araw?

338
00:15:22,944 --> 00:15:24,638
Oo.

339
00:15:24,662 --> 00:15:27,029
Inumin mo rin kasabay nito.

340
00:15:27,052 --> 00:15:29,100
Naiintindihan ko po.

341
00:15:29,123 --> 00:15:31,923
Tatlong araw na gamot ito.

342
00:15:31,946 --> 00:15:36,044
Kailangan ko bang inumin lahat?

343
00:15:36,067 --> 00:15:40,034
Pwede mong ihinto kapag nawala na ang sakit.

344
00:15:40,057 --> 00:15:42,513
Oo, naiintindihan ko po.

345
00:15:42,537 --> 00:15:46,470
Ang bayad ay walong daang yen.

346
00:15:46,493 --> 00:15:48,826
Magbabayad ako ng cash.

347
00:15:48,849 --> 00:15:51,460
Tatanggapin ko ang isang libong yen.

348
00:15:51,484 --> 00:15:53,371
Oo.

349
00:15:53,394 --> 00:15:56,013
Ibabalik ko ang dalawang daang yen.

350
00:15:56,037 --> 00:15:58,170
Ingatan mo ang iyong kalusugan.

351
00:15:58,193 --> 00:16:00,526
Salamat po.